# The Unity project (README.md, "Building"). Unity regenerates all of these.
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/.vs/
/.vsconfig
/*.csproj
/*.sln
/*.slnx

# The game's, BepInEx's, LaunchPad's and core's DLLs: never committed. The dotnet Game build
# copies them in (Main.props, UnityAssemblies). Their .meta files stay, so their import
# settings and GUIDs survive a fresh copy.
/Assets/Assemblies/*.dll
/Assets/Assemblies/*.pdb

# A copy of the repo's About/About.xml for the exporter, made by the Game build (Main.props,
# UnityAbout). The repo's root About/ is the real one.
/Assets/About/
/Assets/About.meta
